---
import SubpageLayout from '../../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
---

<SubpageLayout
  title="Responsible AI & Governance Statement"
  description="Our commitments to transparent, ethical, and verifiable AI engineering."
  status="Official Spec"
  summary="StructZero adheres to verifiable, evidence-based AI engineering — utilizing adversarial review and automated compilation checks to eliminate hallucinations."
  related={[
    { label: 'Workflows & Verification', href: '/docs/workflows/#verification' },
    { label: 'Security Controls', href: '/security/' },
  ]}
>
  <div class="space-y-6">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#F5F7FB] mb-2">Verifiable Code Generation</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#B7C2D6] leading-relaxed">
        StructZero rejects unverified, single-pass AI code output. All proposed files must pass automated syntax compilation, import resolution, and test gates before being committed.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#F5F7FB] mb-2">Multi-Model Neutrality & Independence</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#B7C2D6] leading-relaxed">
        We believe developers should never be locked into a single AI model vendor. Independent models cross-examine architectural drafts to eliminate individual model blind spots.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#F5F7FB] mb-2">Human Authorization Priority</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#B7C2D6] leading-relaxed">
        Autonomous loops are strictly bounded. Operators retain absolute authority over billable cloud infrastructure provisioning, schema migrations, and production releases.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</SubpageLayout>
